# The keyed targets read this key: `make refresh`, `make check-methods`, `make check-addresses`,
# `make check-codegen-live` and `make check-hosted`, none of which spends inference, and `make check-smoke`,
# which runs every method once on production and spends credit.
# Create one in your console at app.pipelex.com, then copy this file to `.env`.
PIPELEX_API_KEY=
